  "semantic_review": "Root read the original host/kernel and all five final Lean modules, the inherited typed result materialization, producer scripts, exact source/frontend evidence, finite API review, schema2 coverage and numeric delta. The host composes read-only device/numel and fresh empty_like metadata/frames with actual existing typed and fp64 source-grid execution. All 17 canonical dtype profiles are retained, including four first-stage fp8 failures, all first primitive failures, empty launches and complete grids. The safe source-grounded CUDA sm90/Triton3.7.1 strided domain includes N=2^31: source i32 offsets remain nonnegative and mask comparison promotes to uint32; N=2^31+1 has an explicit overflow witness and is not mislabeled a frontend reject. Input storage offsets, byte extents, permissions, no-wrap and fresh physical separation derive source pointer applicability. Results are physical flat-prefix values; only pid0 stores and all other programs still execute pre-gate loads/selection. The arbitrary output tail remains unchanged for N>1024. Tensor metadata/allocation, frontend typing and memory/launch primitives are explicit trusted contracts; no final value or successful kernel launch is assumed. Non-JIT test initialization remains inventoried as a harness. The 12 source-selected numerical families bind 84 concrete ports over 39 nonempty successful cases; no float-to-integer UB or false real=floating equality is deferred. Independent original-AST frontend replay and ten CPU metadata cases reproduce evidence; these are not GPU correctness. Full acceptance requires the unchanged exact authority/queue, catalog, schema2 and integration checks after copying.",
